SUMMARY:Thursday Fitness Ride 27R (17-19 mph)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAverage speed: 17-19 mph\
 n\nThis ride has been added to the LBC ride calendar in order to provide a
  time and place during the week for working people to build fitness on an 
 evening ride throughout the spring\, summer and early fall months. In LBC 
 nomenclature\, this is a B/B+ ride level. This new ride will attempt to re
 duce the barriers that exist about joining the Tu/Th evening rides by a cr
 eating medium-paced group.\n\nCue sheet and GPX files: [https://ridewithgp
 s.com/routes/42866619](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42866619)\n\nBring l
 ights as needed\; Helmets are mandatory\; No ear buds. Please bring water\
 , and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n
 \nHelmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devices. Pl
 ease bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump
 /CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we
  require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Bein
 g on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup
 ](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148
 )\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Co
 de of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&c
