SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Brunnerville Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Cue and GPX link:** [Phil's Hills: Brunnerville Repeats](https://ridewithg
 ps.com/routes/50354650)\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total 
 distance of approximately **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a c
 ircuit featuring **1-2 climbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize m
 aintaining a consistent climbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\,
  and repeating the effort to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'l
 l maintain a comfortable average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop
  Policy:** You'll never be left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensu
 re everyone stays together.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earb
 uds or audible music-playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic rep
 air kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
