SUMMARY:Lancaster Bike Club  Adopt A Highway Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nJoin us for a 34 year Lan
 caster Bike Club tradition.\nWhen: Sat. April 18th 7am breakfast\; cleanup
  around 8am.\nWhere: Centerville Diner - 100 S. Centerville Road\, Lancast
 er.\nOur section is a two mile stretch on Columbia Ave between Roherstown 
 Road and Donnerville Road. Park near Painting with a Twist toward the back
  of the lot.\nWhat: Breakfast at Centerville Diner\, followed by cleanup (
 bags\, gloves\, etc are provided)\, then an optional ride.\nWhy: Keep our 
 longstanding tradition going strong! Help beautify our neighborhood. Enjoy
  the camaraderie of club members!\nFor questions contact Allan at apawliko
 @comcast.net or 717-682-8063.\n\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you a
 re a club member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterb
 ikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterb
 ikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agr
 eement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubex
 press.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https:/
 /lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modul
 e_id=323984)
